# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Flint Preview, Recursive's MoE for coding agents (architecture flint: 49 layers, layers 0-1
# dense, 256 experts with 6 active and 2 shared, ~2.5B per token), text only. 35 of its layers
# attend over a 513-token sliding window, so only 14 hold a full-window cache. The experts of
# CPU_MOE layers in system RAM, the rest on the card. The ramp's quality pick for agent work at
# 32 GB, not for chat: every agent task of the tier-1 set, two thirds of its chat tasks (docs/bench.md).
# Sourced by config.env after the configuration, so a configuration value wins over the defaults here.

# Mainline since ggml-org/llama.cpp#30928 (2026-10-21), after the mainline pin Qwen3.6's Vulkan
# build shares, and not in Unsloth's pinned tree: a dir of its own at release b12128, so neither
# pin moves. The release number goes in by hand: the shallow fetch counts one commit, and the build
# fetches the web UI by that number.
: "${LLAMA_REPO:=https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp}"
: "${LLAMA_COMMIT:=a01dff908b9c9311d7af316bba3c918063749bd0}"
: "${LLAMA_DIR:=$LAS_HOME/llama.cpp-flint}"
: "${LLAMA_CMAKE_ARGS:=-DLLAMA_BUILD_NUMBER=12128}"
PATCH_DIR=""

# UD-Q4_K_XL, one file, 25.1 GB: experts 468 MiB per MoE layer (21.5 GiB in all), the rest 1.9 GiB.
: "${MODEL_REPO:=unsloth/flint-GGUF}"
: "${MODEL_REV:=20468edfc38ab43d6914cc88b08cbecb05d0fc62}"
: "${MODEL_FILE:=flint-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf}"
: "${MODEL_SHA256:=63c2ecc461ca545134b670c660e76fa20f47240f8d39b6510bfd21c4dd6e072f}"
: "${MODEL_ALIAS:=flint}"
# Text only: there is no projector, and VISION=1 is refused (config.env).
: "${MMPROJ_FILE:=}"
# What it holds in RAM while serving: VmRSS 24 383 MB at flint's CPU_MOE (2026-11-06,
# runs/T-082-flint-opt/ram.sh), nearly all of it the mapped GGUF; rounded up, so 32 GB of RAM passes
# preflight. Not counted: llama-server's host prompt cache (--cache-ram), which grows with long sessions.
: "${MODEL_DISK_MB:=23900}"
: "${MODEL_RAM_MB:=24500}"
: "${MODEL_RAM_FULL_MB:=0}"
MODEL_BACKENDS="cuda"
# How install.sh and preflight list it in the ramp (README.md#which-model); a configuration may set its own.
: "${MODEL_TITLE:=Flint Preview 40B-A2.5B}"
: "${MODEL_ROLE:=agent quality, ~51 tok/s, weak at chat}"
# Where its pin and settings are explained; preflight names it.
MODEL_DOC="docs/flint.md"
# Offered by install.sh, never recommended (RAMP_ALSO): a bench run has measured it.
MODEL_SUPPORT=supported

# f16/f16: only 14 layers hold the full window, so the cache stays small, and q8_0 decoded 9-16 %
# slower from 65k on (run flint-opt-speed).
: "${KV_K:=f16}"
: "${KV_V:=f16}"
# Empty: the template has no reasoning_effort; the model always thinks.
: "${EFFORT:=}"
# No MTP head, and no small model drafts with its tokenizer here.
: "${SPEC_TYPE:=}"

# The model card's sampling (temperature 1.0, top-p 0.95, top-k 20).
: "${SAMPLING_TEMP:=1.0}"
: "${SAMPLING_TOP_P:=0.95}"
: "${SAMPLING_TOP_K:=20}"
: "${SAMPLING_MIN_P:=0.0}"
